<%#
  Hook extension point for additional <head> content.

  Core intentionally renders nothing here. A hook can override this partial
  (views/default/default/layout/head-extra.ejs in the hook) to contribute extra
  stylesheets, fonts or meta tags without having to fork the whole layout.

  It is included after style.min.css and theme.css, so anything added here wins
  over both the compiled core bundle and the branding theme variables.
%>
